# mm.parse tests

Shared shell scanning: character-class predicates, token-kind superset,
Cursor scanning for both dialects, Sink callback wiring, fragment
production, operator tokenization, line-ending behavior, dollar/quote
skipping, IoNumber detection, excluded-construct rejection, and error
recovery.
